A||||15||pontiacs4me||GTP hood vents!!!!||||1||
Z||000000||pontiacs4me||06-02-2001||02:46 AM||||Alright folks, anyone who has happened to have seen a 2001 special edition GTP or a 2000 Daytona GTP, have seen the ultra cool hood vents they sport.  I just picked up a pair on ebay (Thanks BAM-BAM).  They retail for $270 each from the dealer, so I got a steal on ebay for $166.50 for the pair.  I am going to make molds of these, and reproduce them out of fiberglass, to be used on our poor ventless fiero hoods.  I am working up a picture in photoshop to show what the finished project should look like.  They wont sell for much because Im a great guy.  Thinking probably 60 bucks a pair, shipped!  Then all you have to do is chop up your hood, and fiberglass them in.  They should look real wicked, I have visions, I can see it in my head.  Man im excited.  Im getting my lower quarter panels soon from Ferrari-momo, so I should have my side scoop project done within a few weeks also.  Ill keep yall posted on my progress with the projects, let me know if anyone is interested in anything, and Ill get some pics of my photoshop project posted soon.||||reg||1
