Z||000011||pontiacs4me||06-02-2001||05:02 PM||||the style looks kind of like a 2nd gen trans am fender vent, but smoother and more 21st century like.  They are really low profile, they dont stand above the hood more than 1 inch max.  Look at this pic <A HREF="http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtp1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://home.kscable.com/ccheney/ryanpict/gtp1.jpg</A>   of course on fieros they will have to be mounted on the front of the hood above the radiatior to be functional.  About the door, I dont know man, that might be funky.  Better do it on photoshop first.<P>[This message has been edited by pontiacs4me (edited 06-02-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by pontiacs4me (edited 06-02-2001).]||||reg||1
